  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div><ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Ta thấy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></semantics></math> không thỏa điều kiện <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> không thuộc miền nghiệm của hệ bất phương trình.</li><li>Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>:</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.\n\t\t\t\t<br>Miền nghiệm của hệ bất phương trình là miền trong tứ giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> (có bao gồm cạnh).\n\t\t\t\t<br>Tọa độ các đỉnh là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.\n\t\t\t\t<br>Độ dài <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math>; <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></semantics></math>; <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.\n\t\t\t\t<br>Đây là hình thang <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> có diện tích bằng <div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>:</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div></li><li>Thay <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math> vào bất phương trình <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, ta được <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>≤</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></semantics></math> (sai).<br>Vậy cặp số <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> không là nghiệm hệ bất phương trình.</li><li><ul><li><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> thì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>2032</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> thì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>2035</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> thì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>2030</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> thì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>2024</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.</li></ul>\n\t\t\t\tVậy biểu thức <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> đạt giá trị lớn nhất bằng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>2035</mn></semantics></math> khi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.</li></ol></div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/7bf81af92c4ef9f25586ccec8bdbb2454566a74d758a7e5057709152877fbe0b.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div>",
